{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03002","headline":"南阳道中作 · 张九龄","name":"南阳道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登郢属岁阴，及宛懵所适。\n复闻东汉主，遗此南都迹。\n佳气蔼厥初，霸图纷在昔。\n兹邦称贵近，与世尝薰赫。\n遭遇感风云，变衰空草泽。\n不识邓公树，犹传阴后石。\n驱马历闉闍，荆榛翳阡陌。\n事去物无象，感来心不怿。\n怀古对穷秋，兴言伤远客。\n眇默遵岐路，辛勤弊行役。\n云雁号相呼，林麕走自索。\n顾忆徇书剑，未尝安枕席。\n岂暇墨突黔，空持辽豕白。\n迷复期非远，归欤赏农隙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}